# Freya, Valkyrie

> Freya after the November 2025 rework is a different hero. The 6 Sacred Orb system turned her from a "spam skills for attack speed" duelist into a resource manager: stock orbs before the fight, burn them during Valkyrie state, run dry and you are a melee bruiser with no escape. Patch 2.1.88 shortened the Valkyrie window from 12 to 10 seconds and raised the cooldown, so the cost of wasting orbs or mistiming the dive is higher than ever ([patch notes](/patch-notes)).

