## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Inspire Duelist (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Great Dragon Spear over Malefic Roar when Use when enemy armor is low and you need the post-ultimate movement speed to keep targets inside Valkyrie range.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against shield supports, healing EXP laners, or high-extra-HP frontliners before they finish two defense items.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst that hits before Immortality can convert into a useful second life.
- Total cost: 11650 gold

Default EXP lane setup for winning extended melee trades with Inspire, Corrosion Scythe uptime, and crit-backed basic attacks.

### Jungle Tempo Cleanup (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Sky Piercer, Endless Battle, Malefic Gun, Sea Halberd
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Sky Piercer, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Thrill, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: War Axe over Sky Piercer when Use when the early snowball is not secure and you need steadier stats for Turtle and Lord fights.; Malefic Roar over Malefic Gun when Use when the main targets already have high Physical Defense and extra range is less important than armor conversion.; Immortality over Sea Halberd when Use before late Lord fights when one failed dive would give away the map.
- Total cost: 10750 gold

Jungle Freya build for fast ganks, Ice Retribution chase control, and cleanup pressure after Corrosion Scythe starts sticking targets.

### EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, War Axe, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use against physical skill burst that reaches you before Oracle's shield and regen amp can matter.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when an attack-speed lifesteal core must hit you first in the side lane or front line.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when you are surviving the first engage but cannot finish armor-stacking frontliners.
- Total cost: 11080 gold

Defensive EXP setup for drafts where Freya must enter second, absorb the first burst window, and keep fighting through Valkyrie healing.

